Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.59,0:00:19.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.39,0:00:26.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.37,0:00:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.28,0:00:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for your attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.87,0:00:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.55,0:02:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.01,0:04:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh, oh
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.63,0:05:21.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this news, an explosion\Ntoday in the city of Chariot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.89,0:05:27.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe that the cause of the\Nexplosion is the gas in the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.81,0:05:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I believe that these things\Nare not any problems on the site?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.23,0:05:38.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we have already been told about the\Nevents that happened in the Shara Al-Ghiza?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.55,0:05:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the region of the Hierophant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.81,0:05:48.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.31,0:05:51.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your distance!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.67,0:06:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that all, Johto?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.81,0:06:10.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that all the power you've got?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.35,0:06:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.21,0:06:18.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we see who's the fastest?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.81,0:06:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even remotely close.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.81,0:06:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So many, so many, the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.63,0:06:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time has frozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.81,0:06:49.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy is a mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.17,0:06:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With his inferior level of stand power,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.41,0:06:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand why he was\Nable to survive my attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.85,0:07:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The grand finale was unexpectedly simple
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.53,0:07:14.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Joestar bloodline that has pestered me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.93,0:07:19.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The all-powerful Dio has\Nfinally come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.71,0:07:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.25,0:07:29.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm banged up alright, but I'm alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.33,0:07:31.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.69,0:07:33.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why have I survived again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.59,0:07:38.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, what did you do just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.67,0:07:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm asking you what did you do just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.19,0:07:45.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.15,0:07:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't know, but it looks like your\Nstand ain't all it's cracked up to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.59,0:07:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold your tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.55,0:07:55.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.27,0:08:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.59,0:08:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.95,0:08:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.53,0:08:06.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Platinum.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.37,0:08:37.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without any conscious effort, Star\NPlatinum has been protecting me all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.43,0:08:44.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd swear that for a second I could\Nsee him move inside the frozen time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.43,0:08:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.65,0:08:55.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.73,0:09:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.64,0:09:12.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His star platinum and mine, the\Nworld, are similar types of stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.39,0:09:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How very unexpected of Star Platinum\Nto come into my frozen world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.29,0:09:30.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You watched me from\Nwithin the frozen time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.03,0:09:35.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, not unlike a child learning\Nhow to first ride a bicycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.59,0:09:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll get the hang of it in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.63,0:09:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After Kakyoin revealed\Nthe secret of the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.79,0:09:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you were able to figure out\Nthe idea of time freeze,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.59,0:09:48.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then become aware of\Nmoving inside the frozen time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.63,0:09:52.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose your comrade's death\Nwas not wasted after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.87,0:09:55.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You killed Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.95,0:09:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.35,0:09:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to say to myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.35,0:10:03.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about how many seconds are you actually\Nable to move within the frozen time?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.79,0:10:09.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one second or two seconds or maybe you\Ncan move around for five seconds or so?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.67,0:10:13.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in frozen time like me and are\Njust pretending that you can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.53,0:10:16.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.07,0:10:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's able to move for five seconds before\Nit took everything I had to move for!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.13,0:10:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just an instant I can't let Dio know that\Nit's not enough time for me to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.21,0:10:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,back well I'm sure you don't want me to\Nknow about it but from what I can see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.27,0:10:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you are able to move around\Nonly for an instant at best,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.47,0:10:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you are able to move\Ninside the! frozen time,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.77,0:10:44.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no matter how brief, and to approach\Nyou without caution is not something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.69,0:10:46.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a wise person would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.47,0:10:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The attack you made earlier\Nwas quite stimulating.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.99,0:10:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, but Jotaro...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.89,0:11:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Regardless of all that, I just\Nthought of a way to execute you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.63,0:11:02.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're quite pale.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.75,0:11:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you realized that your end will\Nbe much more terrible than Joseph's?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.95,0:11:10.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A useless gesture!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.77,0:11:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have you in checkmate!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.61,0:11:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.97,0:11:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Explain to me how you're going\Nto get away from these knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.73,0:11:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.71,0:11:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fact that you can see makes\Nit all the more frightening.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.55,0:11:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't do something about it now,\Nyou're going to have problems later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.39,0:12:00.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the best you can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.07,0:12:05.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it has been proven that you can\Nonly move for an instant at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.77,0:12:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that time is up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.07,0:12:24.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all over, but one more to be sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.29,0:12:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To tell you the truth, I'm relieved that\NI was finally able to kill you, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.17,0:12:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You surprised me when you were able\Nto enter my world of frozen time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.87,0:13:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.21,0:13:17.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare he put holes in\Nmy prized school jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.57,0:13:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I managed to survive, thanks to the\Nsplints I put on my broken ribs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.97,0:13:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I've taken some heavy damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.19,0:13:29.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got no choice but to play\Ndead and wait for my chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.81,0:13:34.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he throws knives at me again, I\Ndon't think I'll be able to dodge them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.23,0:13:37.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta deliver a direct blow to his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.05,0:13:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.77,0:13:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.17,0:13:55.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't be too careful when\Ndealing with the Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.17,0:13:58.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the first time that\NI, Dio, have felt fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.17,0:14:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't go near him carelessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.05,0:14:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He might be playing dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.55,0:14:06.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about his breathing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.07,0:14:18.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't hear anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.51,0:14:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.09,0:14:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.75,0:14:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His heart beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.59,0:14:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.83,0:14:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, if I pass out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.43,0:14:55.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, I'm a dead man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.81,0:15:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like some kind of bad joke to stop my
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.31,0:15:07.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,heart with my own stand\Nand to die from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.83,0:15:09.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And die from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.05,0:15:32.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His heart is not beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.63,0:15:36.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is indeed dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.15,0:15:45.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, just to be extra\Ncareful, I'll sever his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.41,0:15:47.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To ensure peace of mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.67,0:15:51.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.43,0:16:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.63,0:16:11.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go straight to hell, D .O.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.85,0:16:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call the ref.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.19,0:16:21.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you able to defeat Emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.63,0:16:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.65,0:16:42.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At last, at last I was able to\Ndeliver a direct blow to his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.43,0:16:44.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got here in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.35,0:16:47.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you finish off Dio?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.55,0:16:50.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, your injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.77,0:16:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget about my injuries and get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.91,0:16:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avenge the deaths of Iggy and Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.15,0:16:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.07,0:17:04.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.79,0:17:09.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.09,0:17:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't move anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.21,0:17:14.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't try to talk, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.97,0:17:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is really pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.17,0:17:22.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.07,0:17:25.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got something to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.91,0:17:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.79,0:17:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happened to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.63,0:17:38.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My legs are weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.53,0:17:42.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My head is splitting and I feel nauseous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.61,0:17:45.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can this be happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.83,0:17:48.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That I deal, feel sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.53,0:17:56.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, Dio, can't stand up because\NJotaro damaged my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.27,0:18:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio, you're not getting away with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.91,0:18:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.15,0:18:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.93,0:18:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.84,0:18:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.93,0:18:30.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.79,0:18:39.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now time?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.23,0:18:40.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.93,0:18:45.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got to make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.65,0:18:48.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can just make it to that place?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.93,0:18:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.91,0:19:00.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can just get there, to that place!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.43,0:19:13.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No more of this playing tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.27,0:19:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta give up now, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.81,0:19:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time freezes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.03,0:19:28.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.49,0:19:38.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got you, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.61,0:19:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may not realize it yet, but you\Njust lost to Dio in this game of wits.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.15,0:19:45.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does this street look familiar to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.61,0:19:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or being the tourist that you\Nare, do all streets look the same?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.55,0:19:54.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This street, can it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.55,0:20:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.35,0:20:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the escape route that allowed\Nme to suck the blood of Joseph Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.33,0:20:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.15,0:20:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.23,0:20:18.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fitting. Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.97,0:20:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feels good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.05,0:20:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This body belongs to my age-old\Nenemy, Jonathan Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.13,0:20:30.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blood I sucked is\Nhis grandson Joseph's,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.13,0:20:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it is his grandson who\Nallowed me to escape, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.65,0:20:37.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bloodline of Joestar\Nhas been a nuisance to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.15,0:20:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not unlike a piece of dog shit in\Nthe middle of the road to my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.17,0:20:47.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in the very end, you are all\Nmeant to be useful to me, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.73,0:20:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.11,0:20:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't really know\Nwhat you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.83,0:20:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.85,0:21:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's squeezed bone dry like you will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.75,0:21:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one could remain\Nunaffected after seeing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.57,0:21:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio, you've done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.97,0:21:16.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've pissed me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.47,0:21:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then this is the final round. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.61,0:21:25.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.19,0:21:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time is frozen!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.91,0:21:51.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite impressive, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.17,0:21:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're actually prolonging\Nthe time you can move around.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.95,0:22:00.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm beginning to feel more power.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.49,0:22:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my new supply of Joestar blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.11,0:22:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am exploding with stand power!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.17,0:22:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stick straight to the bottom, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.81,0:22:45.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.29,0:22:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.71,0:22:49.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not angry enough yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.63,0:23:35.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody stay clear of him! Make way!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.17,0:23:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.35,0:23:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.26,0:23:48.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.11,0:23:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.17,0:23:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Noo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.47,0:24:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels great!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.29,0:24:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This incredible surge of power!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.51,0:24:58.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.03,0:25:03.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's dispense with the\Nwarm-up, shall we, Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.29,0:25:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the last time I freeze time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.25,0:25:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.35,0:25:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm worried that he's not showing himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.05,0:25:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.91,0:25:24.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've decided what I'm going to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.21,0:25:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll blast Star Platinum against\Nhim for as long as I can move.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.21,0:25:35.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's one thing I'm very sure of, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.87,0:25:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next time I see your face,\NI'm probably gonna lose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.45,0:25:42.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will go totally berserk.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.81,0:25:45.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.07,0:25:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An oil tanker for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.03,0:26:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crushed to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.69,0:26:29.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.17,0:26:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At last, I've stamped out\Nthe bloodline of Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.59,0:26:40.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it is proven that no one is\Ngreater in the world than I, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.31,0:26:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You insignificant human beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.27,0:26:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall rule over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.59,0:26:48.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will grovel at my feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.91,0:26:54.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha! Ha! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.29,0:26:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.20,0:27:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ha
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.53,0:27:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.99,0:27:07.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.83,0:27:14.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I.. I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.95,0:27:16.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.75,0:27:19.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My body isn't moving at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.63,0:27:22.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you've moved all you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.49,0:27:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wha...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.40,0:27:26.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.09,0:27:37.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who froze time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.51,0:27:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.23,0:27:45.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How does it feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.57,0:27:49.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's it like wanting\Nso desperately to move?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.59,0:27:58.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now time flows.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.63,0:28:05.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no mercy in my heart for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.39,0:28:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't feel sorry for you one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.53,0:28:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately I still have a conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.41,0:28:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So torturing you to death would\Nprobably leave a bad taste in my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.65,0:28:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many seconds will it\Ntake for that leg to heal?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.77,0:28:24.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna blast you with my star\Nplatinum just as soon as you recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.79,0:28:25.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.97,0:28:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you insult me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.73,0:28:35.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Jotaro, even now, at this crucial\Nmoment, you are, after all, only human.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.83,0:28:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And your way of thinking\Nis extremely limited.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.23,0:28:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that leave a bad taste in your mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.87,0:28:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such thinking is equivalent to rat shit in\Na pit, and it will be your fatal mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.23,0:28:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, Dio, am different.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.55,0:28:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is only one simple ideal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.23,0:29:01.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Victory and conquest, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.95,0:29:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The process and method
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.23,0:29:10.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doesn't really matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.55,0:29:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.87,0:29:14.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.93,0:29:33.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get! I
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.41,0:29:40.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.13,0:29:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.23,0:29:44.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio cannot die!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.05,0:29:59.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only one reason\Nfor your defeat, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.61,0:30:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One simple little thing and that's.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.53,0:30:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all you really really pissed me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.71,0:30:25.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then when I woke up I was in the Speed
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.97,0:30:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wagon Foundation's paramedic helicopter.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.91,0:30:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through my comrades'
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.55,0:30:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,battle, and a blood transfusion from Dio's\Nremains, yes, I was able to be revived.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.23,0:30:45.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I owe it all to my grandson, and to the\Nprecious lives that can never be restored.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.47,0:30:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The terrifying evil is now\Ndisappearing into the Red Sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.03,0:30:52.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,along with the shimmer of the morning sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.73,0:31:00.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I live, I will never\Nforget about this journey, this site.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.99,0:31:15.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Kakyoin,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.79,0:31:20.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iggy, Avdol,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.81,0:31:24.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.01,0:31:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you insist on going\Nback to France, Polnareff?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.33,0:31:44.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have any family there, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.25,0:31:47.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why not come to my place?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.39,0:31:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.33,0:31:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.24,0:31:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, although I have no family\Nleft, France is my homeland.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.07,0:31:59.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think often of my hometown.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.29,0:32:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter where I go, it is\Nthe place I always return to.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.11,0:32:05.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't hesitate to call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.01,0:32:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll come as fast as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.39,0:32:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From anywhere in the world\NI might happen to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.87,0:32:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll certainly miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.05,0:32:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had many painful and\Ndifficult situations.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.81,0:32:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I wouldn't have\Nmissed it for the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.05,0:32:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of all of you,\Nthe journey was enjoyable.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.63,0:32:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.21,0:32:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I enjoyed it as well, from\Nthe bottom of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.49,0:32:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.43,0:33:00.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try not to get yourself killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.29,0:33:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hear, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.01,0:33:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and your damn grandson
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.11,0:33:07.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you two forget about me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.53,0:33:09.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.95,0:33:12.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless you try to steer\Nclear of me, that is!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.33,0:33:14.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right then.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.85,0:33:15.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.19,0:33:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody could ever forget a guy like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.71,0:33:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if they really wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.27,0:33:25.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take care now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.57,0:33:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mama, Mama, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.53,0:33:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holly!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.91,0:33:51.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, why, you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.17,0:33:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.03,0:33:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.11,0:33:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.25,0:34:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of a sudden, I just\Nfeel completely fine again.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.77,0:34:03.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In any case, we have to get ready. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.29,0:34:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll be coming home soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.63,0:34:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Papa and Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.01,0:34:11.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it, Mama. Very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.63,0:34:13.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll be coming home at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.79,0:36:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.

